{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 14185284823614304826,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "FlakeHub",
      "source_hash": 9622631116113486238,
      "context_hash": 9714146954583185474,
      "translation": "FlakeHub",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "FlakeHub": "FlakeHub"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:15.014915Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "A service that does fun stuff",
      "source_hash": 14451763616013801937,
      "context_hash": 3946822774504348347,
      "translation": "재미있는 작업을 수행하는 서비스입니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:15.014916Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "[FlakeHub] is a platform for discovering and publishing [Nix flakes][flakes] built by [Determinate Systems][detsys].",
      "source_hash": 1187459648977766746,
      "context_hash": 13428389282668905363,
      "translation": "[FlakeHub]는 [Determinate Systems][detsys]가 만든 [Nix 플레이크][flakes]를 탐색하고 게시하는 플랫폼입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "FlakeHub": "FlakeHub",
        "Nix": "Nix",
        "Determinate Systems": "Determinate Systems",
        "flakes": "플레이크"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:15.014916Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "It offers a wide variety of features that Nix on its own does not:",
      "source_hash": 17763194839087272848,
      "context_hash": 2069727001836439306,
      "translation": "Nix 단독으로는 제공하지 않는 다양한 기능을 제공합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Nix": "Nix"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:15.014917Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "[Semantic versioning][semver] for flakes, including version modifiers like `~` (flexible patch) and `=` (exact match).",
      "source_hash": 8601857965857142237,
      "context_hash": 12722624149387945298,
      "translation": "`~`(유연한 패치)와 `=`(정확히 일치)와 같은 버전 수정자를 포함한 플레이크용 [유의적 버전][semver]",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "semantic versioning": "유의적 버전",
        "semver": "semver",
        "flakes": "플레이크"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:15.014917Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "The ability to explore the Nix flake landscape in a variety of ways:",
      "source_hash": 17346311338253939392,
      "context_hash": 13021669712616588180,
      "translation": "다양한 방식으로 Nix 플레이크 생태계를 탐색할 수 있는 기능:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Nix": "Nix",
        "flake": "플레이크"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:15.014917Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Plaintext search",
      "source_hash": 3151422472897592058,
      "context_hash": 1882047306543886079,
      "translation": "일반 텍스트 검색",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:15.014917Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "[All flakes][all-flakes]",
      "source_hash": 17060599199096745598,
      "context_hash": 8666995740069875874,
      "translation": "[모든 플레이크][all-flakes]",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "flakes": "플레이크"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:15.014918Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "[All organizations][all-orgs]",
      "source_hash": 14586590381323769012,
      "context_hash": 14821365271634538587,
      "translation": "[모든 조직][all-orgs]",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:15.014918Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "Via labels such as [`nixos`][label-nixos] or [`rust`][label-rust]",
      "source_hash": 2318877073622585324,
      "context_hash": 6225287951693352588,
      "translation": "[`nixos`][label-nixos]나 [`rust`][label-rust]와 같은 레이블을 통한 탐색",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "NixOS": "NixOS"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:15.014918Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "Automated flake [publishing] with GitHub Actions, including a user-friendly [wizard] to help you construct an Actions configuration for your project.",
      "source_hash": 18166028507755573759,
      "context_hash": 4169089606243465989,
      "translation": "프로젝트를 위한 Actions 설정 구성을 돕는 사용하기 쉬운 [마법사][wizard]를 포함한, GitHub Actions를 이용한 자동화된 플레이크 [게시][publishing]",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "flake": "플레이크",
        "configuration": "설정"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:15.014918Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "FlakeHub also offers a CLI tool called [`fh`][fh] that you can use to perform a variety of actions against the FlakeHub API.",
      "source_hash": 2211706144819988971,
      "context_hash": 5126134820338535264,
      "translation": "FlakeHub는 또한 FlakeHub API에 대해 다양한 작업을 수행하는 데 사용할 수 있는 [`fh`][fh]라는 CLI 도구를 제공합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "FlakeHub": "FlakeHub"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:15.014918Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "FlakeHub is a proprietary platform",
      "source_hash": 4881175087313253407,
      "context_hash": 2004595098982904709,
      "translation": "FlakeHub는 독점 플랫폼입니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "FlakeHub": "FlakeHub"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:15.014918Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:14/seg:0",
      "source": "Although we at [Determinate Systems][detsys] believe that FlakeHub makes important aspects of using [Nix flakes][flakes] more straightforward&mdash;and fun!&mdash;it is a proprietary platform and mostly not open source.",
      "source_hash": 15601956152198301230,
      "context_hash": 14192498915868471780,
      "translation": "[Determinate Systems][detsys]인 저희는 FlakeHub가 [Nix 플레이크][flakes] 사용의 중요한 측면들을 더 간단하게&mdash;그리고 재미있게!&mdash;만들어준다고 믿지만, 이는 독점 플랫폼이며 대체로 오픈 소스가 아닙니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "FlakeHub": "FlakeHub",
        "Nix": "Nix",
        "flakes": "플레이크",
        "Determinate Systems": "Determinate Systems"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:15.014919Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:14/seg:1",
      "source": "Most of FlakeHub's features are free, including [semantic versioning][semver] and publishing [public flakes][visibility]",
      "source_hash": 13010888708808274567,
      "context_hash": 9799515102027031876,
      "translation": "[유의적 버전][semver]과 [공개 플레이크][visibility] 게시를 포함해, FlakeHub의 기능 대부분은 무료입니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "semantic versioning": "유의적 버전",
        "semver": "semver",
        "flakes": "플레이크",
        "FlakeHub": "FlakeHub"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:15.014919Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:15/seg:0",
      "source": "In other words, you can use [Nix] and [Nix flakes][flakes] without using FlakeHub just as you can use [Git] without using [GitHub].",
      "source_hash": 62409390974144986,
      "context_hash": 12060339436772643931,
      "translation": "다시 말해, [Git]을 [GitHub] 없이 사용할 수 있는 것처럼 FlakeHub 없이도 [Nix]와 [Nix 플레이크][flakes]를 사용할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "flakes": "플레이크",
        "Nix": "Nix",
        "FlakeHub": "FlakeHub"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:15.014919Z",
      "issues": []
    }
  ]
}
